@startuml
[*] --> Order_pending
state "🔄 awaiting_capture" as Order_awaiting_capture
state "🔄 cancelled" as Order_cancelled
state "🔄 paid" as Order_paid
state "🔄 shipped" as Order_shipped
state "🔄 pending" as Order_pending
state "🔄 delivered" as Order_delivered
Order_awaiting_capture --> Order_cancelled : ✅ Cancel Order
Order_awaiting_capture --> Order_paid : ✅ Capture Payment
Order_paid --> Order_shipped : ✅ Ship Order
Order_pending --> Order_awaiting_capture : ✅ Enter Payment Information
Order_pending --> Order_cancelled : ✅ Cancel Order
Order_shipped --> Order_delivered : ✅ Confirm Delivery
@enduml
